ISO-10303-21;
HEADER;
/*
  Component:  ISO 4762 - M4 x 20
  Standard:   ISO 4762:2004
  Family:     hexagon socket head cap screw
  Size:       M4
  Length:     20 mm
  Data source: ISO 4762:2004 head/socket table; nominal values, see components/DATA_SOURCES.md
  Notes:      Layered solid: plain shank, head floor, blind hex socket. Socket represented by a ring with a through hex hole over a floor disc. No head chamfer is modeled. A swept helical thread ridge is modeled.
*/
